{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0454_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d35ede5b598ca3233c851f18d312205a32c2c30291daabf20d7e2bbe3ab849d0", "ja": "（のり子の新しい衣装は、貴婦人のドレスがテーマだ。\n試着をしてもらっているが、様子はどうだろうか……）", "zh": "（典子的新服装以贵妇人的礼服为主题。现在正让她试穿，不知道效果怎么样……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0454_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "9232e622a536422f0ad46d27857443580945c1f37f9410934b6b085e0cc58965", "ja": "う～ん、やっぱりイメージどおりに動くの\n結構難しいな～……。", "zh": "嗯～，果然要按照想象中的样子行动还是挺难的～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0454_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5716dcca0b366901da75ac850c13b7aa58b94965a6cb43760321dc1151c6a330", "ja": "お疲れさま、のり子。\n着心地はどうだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，法子。穿起来感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0454_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "180686bc2d278672492af1b4351c1665a8c063448091a95dd1aac7abb68ba52b", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れ！　衣装自体は\n問題なし！　すごくカワイイし、素敵なんだけど……。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦啦！服装本身没问题！特别可爱，也很漂亮，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0454_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d0d86938a20e6bb29da6a4f44b9117c585ed8e6001cbc6b37a4e10fa79c7d3c0", "ja": "ん？　なにか気になるとこでもあったか？", "zh": "嗯？是有什么在意的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0454_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "5b1ff0b9b2343567943721b8555cda8fcdc4a1c88b58302e1b4de3f57c30da30", "ja": "うん……。この衣装、ドレスだけど\nアイドルの衣装でもあるじゃない？", "zh": "嗯……这身服装虽然是礼服，\n但也同样是偶像的服装对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0454_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "df41327ffb79418cbfb21c638f977bce4d06c6ebb1c4e50c825d96ec905ca7fd", "ja": "ステージ上で動くとなると、衣装の良さが\nみんなに伝わらないかもって思ったんだよね。", "zh": "一想到要在舞台上活动，我就觉得，可能没办法把这套服装的优点传达给大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0454_1007_p", "source_sha256": "68bc8e8275dd3207ce3bc4f8579aea06559efac96ed666ca2b1371517f293097", "ja": "なるほど……。", "zh": "原来如此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0454_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "555a129146ee01b22644afb501b4811855a479f0b2884c249603ecd5eec76a4e", "ja": "衣装のイメージに合わせて、貴婦人っぽく\n優雅に動けたらな―って思って試してたんだけど……", "zh": "我想着要是能配合服装的形象，像贵妇人一样优雅地行动就好了——所以试了试，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0454_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "0a4583105056e82945c23f2389c4a9bcc9b5b9043dc2c5b4ca1ab09fd572645f", "ja": "普段はやらない動きだから、うまくいかなくて。", "zh": "平时不会做这种动作，所以做不太好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0454_1010_p", "source_sha256": "cfb299b6a1dbda73e97fa30544fa17eed902ebd8267456acde096b8199360661", "ja": "確かに……細かい所作は、慣れも大切だからな。\n意識して着ていれば、衣装も動きも馴染むと思うよ。", "zh": "确实……细微的举止动作，习惯也很重要。\n有意识地穿着的话，我觉得你会慢慢适应服装和动作的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0454_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "8655207148a152215ca01c5f4b08467ff1f64faa9aac6cbb086df3ef077339e7", "ja": "……それもそっか！　じゃあ、これからもっとたくさん\n着て、アタシのものにしてみせるよ♪", "zh": "……确实也是！那从今以后，我要多穿穿这些服装，把它们真正变成属于我的东西♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0454_1012_p", "source_sha256": "26358e3042ce430a3d9ea12bdf29d2ccc4215e470604df3641790e4a2ef45e32", "ja": "ああ。その意気だ！", "zh": "啊，就是这个劲头！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0454_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "c63be15e7cf5a7f4b9a84c26bc9adebd33765ba32c4ae6cc03b143684fc2c143", "ja": "でね……その一歩として、これからこの衣装で\n劇場をぐるっと歩いてみようかなって思うんだけど。", "zh": "所以呢……作为第一步，我想着接下来要不要穿着这身衣服在剧场里走一圈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0454_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "2fe9ab264981fca7899caff7f089e87e44d798e0b5c9d923da567b38e6c01a0b", "ja": "……{$P$}、付き合ってくれる？", "zh": "……{$P$}，能陪我一起吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0454_1015_p", "source_sha256": "bf406d79c29dd38f95f46d784027e8f944da789699cfd1ea9eb796f7fd83faef", "ja": "もちろん。歩きにくいだろうし、\nよければ、エスコートしようか？", "zh": "当然。走起来不方便吧，要是你不介意的话，我来为你引路？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0454_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "b44276352c5d7c982c935cf5e5a0132bc997b5c81f4aac9493309bfb387d192a", "ja": "本当？　それじゃあ、お願いしようかな。", "zh": "真的？那就拜托你啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0454_1017_p", "source_sha256": "f97a47b0f15d8e8f9efa836ef91fc98478e1364ec3451925b2091b704b501b68", "ja": "ああ、任せてくれ。\nじゃあ、手を借りてもいいかな。", "zh": "啊，交给我吧。\n那么，可以借我你的手吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0454_1018_043nor", "source_sha256": "ba10f6426a9c0ffc3fc825fc31f5cba60dc8f7aee8a89cbf31957843d8b4f9a6", "ja": "わかった。手を……ええっ！？　て、手ぇ握るの！？", "zh": "明白了。手……诶！？要、要牵手吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0454_1019_p", "source_sha256": "95a49e0895c42bc137696c60f2e342b5556d365d483af21afe03e6038aa8c854", "ja": "えっ？　ああ、そうか……。\n腕に手を添えるのが正しいんだったか？", "zh": "咦？啊，原来如此……  \n是应该把手搭在手臂上吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0454_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "9341800a9627643b565529c459b5a4d8d2e31fb82a12dc6cd09720717e64ff6a", "ja": "え、そ、そうなの！？　それでも緊張するけど……\nでもこんな機会、次はいつあるか……よし！", "zh": "咦，原、原来是这样！？可就算这样还是会紧张……\n不过这种机会，下次还不知道什么时候才有……好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_043nor0454_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_043nor0454_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "89992161075ad2d2cff7d2c1364ab33092d3868ec5527c5e3e00b1a7eb70fcf0", "ja": "{$P$}、\nエスコート、よろしくお願いします……！", "zh": "{$P$}，\n请好好护送我……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
